# Local secrets
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example

# Installed dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Optional portable runtime downloaded by 快捷启动/快捷启动脚本/准备运行环境.cmd.
# Keep GitHub/source distribution light; local/offline ZIP packages may include these folders.
快捷启动/随项目必须的安装包/_downloads/
快捷启动/随项目必须的安装包/_node_extract_tmp/
快捷启动/随项目必须的安装包/corepack/
快捷启动/随项目必须的安装包/message-platform-vendor/
快捷启动/随项目必须的安装包/node/
快捷启动/随项目必须的安装包/pnpm-store/

# Runtime logs and state
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*.jsonl
**/dispatch_state.json
**/job_store.json
**/job_display_index.json

# Browser profiles and local caches
**/ChromeProfile/
**/chrome-profile/
**/.cache/
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# Recruitment runtime data. Keep placeholder directories only.
**/data/*
!**/data/.gitkeep
!**/data/drafts/
**/data/drafts/*
!**/data/drafts/.gitkeep
!**/data/sent/
**/data/sent/*
!**/data/sent/.gitkeep

# Generated reports. Keep placeholder directories only.
**/outputs/*
!**/outputs/.gitkeep

# OS/editor noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
